{"id":"74086485fba8d86f","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Topological Space","display":"df-zfc-top5-topological-space — ZFC Top5 Topological Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-topological-space — ZFC Top5 Topological Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-topological-space — ZFC Top5 Topological Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99a7a09e1b39c781\" href=\"?note=99a7a09e1b39c781\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"481582931ea56519\" href=\"?note=481582931ea56519\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> is the power set from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99a7a09e1b39c781\" href=\"?note=99a7a09e1b39c781\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup\\mathcal U\">\\(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\)</span> is the union of a set-family as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"481582931ea56519\" href=\"?note=481582931ea56519\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}topological\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\land\\;\\emptyset\\in\\tau\\;\\land\\;X\\in\\tau\\;\\land\\;\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\tau)\\;\\land\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;(U\\cap V\\in\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}topological\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\land\\;\\emptyset\\in\\tau\\;\\land\\;X\\in\\tau\\;\\land\\;\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\tau)\\;\\land\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;(U\\cap V\\in\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Binary-intersection closure implies closure under all finite intersections, while the quantified family clause gives arbitrary-union closure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":